      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u006",
      "targetTextSha256": "c981beae6dee1302d70cc0982b907ed5c768d829f7714eb68af1f5250e5d1b15",
      "audioSha256": "dc25abdc178fd9f1743dcf722796a5d2c2345cd2c7c7471403be7b69b173604e",
      "recognized": "就是以道德上完全的方式。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u007",
      "targetTextSha256": "0527b4e1be58506d21efca51fedfcd63b2de91ef310fc1cea9df2fde56f806c8",
      "audioSha256": "12ecdac11381dd90a7decb57f322c58cd3b1e3b13e65609913c589af0bd9c59e",
      "recognized": "正因如此，当我们看第八章的时候，真是令人惊叹。在神的警告，也就是号角的警告，还没有发出之前。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u008",
      "targetTextSha256": "031562d454508857fb09be1db7c6616f8d5e47cc0b51cb0b0ee6e69102b0ad66",
      "audioSha256": "f9dfb5585a4de34ef2cb11a9ad10179f924c64a7885d96557e4e8533f025e4f8",
      "recognized": "使徒约翰，也就是作者，首先清楚地确立了神的圣洁。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u009",
      "targetTextSha256": "952621eb69d99afb08c090943ff5980db9be3b0e0283aac8cd1048de3bdff507",
      "audioSha256": "7509abe2b9bf1aa0be09b3b38f6d940c30deed9d0cd91d990cdd94aa5943c32f",
      "recognized": "这在两方面令人惊叹。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u010",
      "targetTextSha256": "2b6d6d579cf2073ff358f7022364793b30d69e3b3ddbd6ce1223710853a89ed5",
      "audioSha256": "f6162331166e3fd41eb727b7face8702fa22996c4cd46e44bdd0cefd190fb28e",
      "recognized": "第一是借着静默。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u011",
      "targetTextSha256": "a80ee073782390ff342e4fbc4d27a25ae95cdb836f38ed3eefd70682bdf43d84",
      "audioSha256": "3571ab74b2aa93ea154352c074678c45987106baa254809294826f7e03c70e2e",
      "recognized": "静默。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u012",
      "targetTextSha256": "0d33f82f666947507fd7f667c11281b05ba8f8c912bea74bf7bf71f68bcf85cf",
      "audioSha256": "4233609492d24c2fe944c5fdb9c691973cfc1263d489ab0273d82489bf03032a",
      "recognized": "你知道，在旧约里，静默和神的圣洁常常是连在一起的。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u013",
      "targetTextSha256": "cf73a5e68f015bf6fdd2dc9805db9646837f3924712d5f1aff7b41369c3d391e",
      "audioSha256": "fb5a05084e5c9f4f4d5e8550378287fda5667d4ebf26055ba7b84d2642a47c96",
      "recognized": "比如，我们来看《哈巴谷书》第二章。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "requires_review"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u014",
